Bundled data provenance and notices

Stellar catalogue (ephemeris/sefstars.txt.xz)
Stored with lossless xz compression; expanded into session-temporary storage
for Swiss Ephemeris. No stellar values are altered.
Compiled by Fabio Silva. On 4 November 2026 the maintainer confirmed that
this is his own compilation of NASA data retrieved through SIMBAD.
This is not represented as a copy of the standard Swiss Ephemeris catalogue.
SIMBAD is operated by CDS, Strasbourg; NASA is the maintainer-reported
upstream data source. The precise upstream catalogue identifiers and retrieval
date are unknown to the maintainer. No blanket NASA ownership claim is made for
all records available through SIMBAD.

